ast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">인 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">반드시 동아리 형태가 아니어도 됨</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:19.1pt;text-indent:-19.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">모집내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">과학체험콘텐츠 부스 기획</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">운영</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:19.1pt;text-indent:-19.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">안내사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:19.1pt;text-indent:-19.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">부스 주제는 자유이나 과학 원리를 바탕으로 체험콘텐츠를 구성하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:19.1pt;text-indent:-19.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">부스 선정 시 부대시설과 부스 기획</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">운영을 위한 비용 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">예산 범위 내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:19.1pt;text-indent:-19.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">접수기한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2024.8.15.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:19.1pt;text-indent:-19.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">접수방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">국립중앙과학관 사이언스데이 담당자 메일로 신청서 제출</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 130%;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardCont